                        <span class="px-10 pt-4 pb-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Kalender & Promosi</span>
                        <a href="/category/percetakan?sub=kalender-dinding" class="flex items-center gap-3 py-2 pl-10 pr-6 text-sm text-base-content/80 hover:text-primary"><Icon name="lucide:calendar" class="w-4 h-4 text-[#233876]" /> Kalender Dinding</a>
