                        <a href="/category/undangan?sub=hardcover" class="flex items-center gap-3 py-2.5 pl-10 pr-6 text-sm text-base-content/80 hover:text-primary"><Icon name="lucide:layers" class="w-4 h-4 text-[#233876]" /> Undangan Hardcover</a>
