                        <a href="/category/souvenir?sub=payung" class="flex items-center gap-3 py-2 pl-10 pr-6 text-sm text-base-content/80 hover:text-primary"><Icon name="lucide:umbrella" class="w-4 h-4 text-[#233876]" /> Payung</a>
